          "implication": "The current SAP document carries a July 2018 amendment header, after the reported January 2018 primary analysis; the protocol also contains a later 2020 amendment. These current document dates alone cannot prove when every current analysis detail was finalized, although the SAP's version history records earlier 2015 and 2017 versions and the protocol says general investigator unblinding occurred after 2019 analyses."
