        }
      ],
      "justification": "The SAP history records a final version dated 27-Aug-2015 and a further version dated 6-Jun-2017; the dated amendments remove interim PFS analyses and update PFS analysis details. The current SAP specifies local-radiology PFS in the FAS, stratified log-rank testing and a stratified Cox hazard ratio, corresponding to the approved local PFS result. The protocol describes the primary analysis in January 2018 and says participants and investigators were unblinded after planned inferential analyses were complete in 2019. This supports, by inference, that the 2017 analysis intentions preceded investigator unblinding. I use probably_yes because the exact access date for investigators involved in the January 2018 analysis is not separately stated, and the SAP copy currently captured also contains a July 2018 amendment after the analysis/publication.",
